      "tags": ["component", "client-component", "animation", "hero", "image"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "Combines Framer Motion `useMotionValue`/`useSpring` with `useMotionTemplate` to build a CSS radial-gradient string that updates without React re-renders."
